{
  "format_version": 1,
  "name": "GZCLP",
  "origin": "Cody Lefever (GZCL tier method); GZCLP structure as documented on the r/Fitness wiki",
  "source": {
    "url": "https://thefitness.wiki/routines/gzclp/",
    "method_url": "https://swoleateveryheight.blogspot.com/2014/07/the-gzcl-method-simplified_13.html",
    "note": "Structure only: which lifts, how many sets and reps, when load moves. Written in our own words from the cited pages, no text reproduced. A training method is not copyrightable expression (17 U.S.C. 102(b), research/16 'The licence rule')."
  },
  "progression_unit": "session",
  "dose": "sets",
  "days": 3,
  "notes": "Four workouts rotate in order regardless of weekday; the source runs them 3 to 4 times a week, so spacing is the user's. No rest nodes: the rotation is not pinned to a weekly grid. T1 starts at 85% of a tested 5RM; T2 and T3 starting loads are set at intake, the source gives no single number worth asserting.",
  "rotation": [
    {
      "id": "A1",
      "label": "A1 (squat T1, bench T2)",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "label": "T1",
          "exercise": "Barbell_Squat",
          "amrap_last": true,
          "start": {"kind": "retest_pct", "test": "5rm", "pct": 0.85},
          "stages": [
            {"sets": 5, "reps": 3, "amrap_last": true},
            {"sets": 6, "reps": 2, "amrap_last": true},
            {"sets": 10, "reps": 1, "amrap_last": true}
          ],
          "progression": {
            "axis": "weight",
            "increment": 10,
            "increment_unit": "lb",
            "advance_when": {"kind": "all_prescribed_reps"},
            "on_miss": "next_stage",
            "reset": {"kind": "retest_pct", "test": "5rm", "pct": 0.85, "stage": 0}
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "T2",
          "exercise": "Barbell_Bench_Press_-_Medium_Grip",
          "stages": [
            {"sets": 3, "reps": 10},
            {"sets": 3, "reps": 8},
            {"sets": 3, "reps": 6}
          ],
          "progression": {
            "axis": "weight",
            "increment": 5,
            "increment_unit": "lb",
            "advance_when": {"kind": "all_prescribed_reps"},
            "on_miss": "next_stage",
            "reset": {"kind": "load_delta", "value": 15, "unit": "lb", "stage": 0}
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "T3",
          "exercise": "Wide-Grip_Lat_Pulldown",
          "sets": 3,
          "reps": 15,
          "amrap_last": true,
          "progression": {
            "axis": "weight",
            "increment": 5,
            "increment_unit": "lb",
            "advance_when": {"kind": "amrap_at_least", "reps": 25},
            "on_miss": "hold"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
